[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4081.52, "timestamp": "01:08:01", "text": "我的天啊。就像《绝命毒师》一样。它是 太逼真了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4089.71, "timestamp": "01:08:09", "text": "哦，等等。不对，开头错了。拉屎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4092.549, "timestamp": "01:08:12", "text": "哦。我的天啊。那是赫克托吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4096.309, "timestamp": "01:08:16", "text": "是赫克托。这是花蜜。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4100.47, "timestamp": "01:08:20", "text": "内克塔叔叔。等等，你们在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4102.55, "timestamp": "01:08:22", "text": "哦，等等。我当时正在做教程。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4104.87, "timestamp": "01:08:24", "text": "意思是，哦，不。你只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4107.43, "timestamp": "01:08:27", "text": "事情就是这样开始的吗？呃，等等。我在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4109.749, "timestamp": "01:08:29", "text": "货车。你在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4111.829, "timestamp": "01:08:31", "text": "不，是在序言里。是的，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4113.43, "timestamp": "01:08:33", "text": "这是序章，仅限单人游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4115.269, "timestamp": "01:08:35", "text": "模式。序幕之后，就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4119.59, "timestamp": "01:08:39", "text": "多人游戏。好的。好的。啊，让我想想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4121.189, "timestamp": "01:08:41", "text": "所以，我们得先写序言。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4125.669, "timestamp": "01:08:45", "text": "完事后再来跟我谈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4126.95, "timestamp": "01:08:46", "text": "《我到底是什么鬼》里的所有东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4129.43, "timestamp": "01:08:49", "text": "应该在“好的”中这样做。呃，现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4134.03, "timestamp": "01:08:54", "text": "探索一下这辆厢式货车。呃，使用闪光效果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4137.11, "timestamp": "01:08:57", "text": "收成。我这里有底漆吗？哦，我"}]